The actual implementation of the image transformation methods (`applyGrayscale`, `adjustBrightness`, `detectEdges`) would need to be filled in with appropriate logic. Additionally, error handling, input validation, and integration with an external logging service (if required) should be added based on specific requirements and constraints.']

